CLI.md §3.19, API.md L10, L11: with --fix, one line per fix comes first, a complete canon edit request based on the revision linted; then the findings, then the summary. szName has no fix: its clean name is taken.
-- args --
lint
--fix
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// A unit.
record Unit {
  /// Health.
  dwHealth: Int
  /// Its name.
  szName: String = ""
  /// A field holding the clean name of szName.
  name: String = ""
}

/// The units.
let units: [Unit] = [{ dwHealth: 3 }]
-- want --
[exit 0]
[stdout]
