{"severity":"warning","code":"W0001","file":"a/a.canon","line":7,"col":3,"endLine":7,"endCol":11,"package":"a","message":"field dwHealth keeps the legacy prefix dw in its Canon name: rename it health (canon rename keeps the old wire name with @json where a load or a data emit reads the field)"}
{"severity":"warning","code":"W0001","file":"a/a.canon","line":9,"col":3,"endLine":9,"endCol":9,"package":"a","message":"field szName keeps the legacy prefix sz in its Canon name: rename it name (canon rename keeps the old wire name with @json where a load or a data emit reads the field)"}
